      "content": "oh wow okay i didn't realize it was that serious. i was just so desperate bc i haven't slept more than a couple hours in like 3 nights. but i really can't wait until i can get a doctor's appointment tomorrow or next week... is there really no way i can just take a small amount tonight? like just like 25mg or something? i just feel like i'm at a breaking point.",
